  <section class="doc" id="en">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="meta">
      Last updated: 2026 · Developer: <strong>Hidroteknik A.Ş.</strong> (Denizli, Türkiye)<br />
      Contact: <a href="mailto:aishot@hidroteknik.com.tr">aishot@hidroteknik.com.tr</a> · +90 258 251 40 60<br />
      Address: Sümer 2296 No:21 Alyaz İş Merkezi No:1, 20175 Merkezefendi / Denizli, Türkiye
    </div>

    <p>AIShot is a desktop screen assistant for Windows. This policy explains what data the app does and does not process. In short: <strong>AIShot does not create an account for you, does not collect personal data, and does not send your data to our servers.</strong></p>

    <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
    <p>AIShot <strong>does not collect, store or transmit any personal data to us.</strong> The app has:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No</strong> account/sign-up system.</li>
      <li><strong>No</strong> telemetry, analytics or usage tracking.</li>
      <li><strong>No</strong> ads or third-party trackers.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Where data is stored</h2>
    <p>All data stays <strong>only on your computer</strong>:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Chat sessions and screenshots:</strong> Stored locally on your device (localStorage). You can delete them anytime from within the app.</li>
      <li><strong>Your AI API key:</strong> Stored <strong>encrypted</strong> at the OS level (Windows DPAPI) on your device. It is never written in plain text, never shown again in the UI, and <strong>never transmitted to us</strong>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Some features require the internet and send data <strong>directly to the third-party services you authorize</strong>. This data does <strong>not</strong> pass through our servers.</p>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Data sent</th><th>Recipient</th></tr>
      <tr><td>AI interpretation/chat</td><td>Text extracted from the screen via OCR and the messages you type</td><td>The provider you choose in Settings (Groq, OpenRouter, DeepSeek, OpenAI, etc.)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Text-to-speech (TTS)</td><td>The text to be read aloud</td><td>Microsoft (Edge neural voice service)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Text recognition (OCR)</td><td>—</td><td>Local on your device; only language data is downloaded on first run</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="note"><strong>Important:</strong> The screenshot itself is not sent to the AI; only the text locally extracted from it is sent. The privacy policy of the provider you choose applies to the data you send to it.</div>

    <h2>4. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>AIShot is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

    <h2>5. Data security</h2>
    <p>Your API key is protected by OS-level encryption. Avoid capturing screens containing sensitive/personal information, as the extracted text will be sent to your chosen provider.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes</h2>
    <p>This policy may be updated. The current version is always published at this address and is accessible from the <strong>About</strong> section in the app.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions: <a href="mailto:aishot@hidroteknik.com.tr">aishot@hidroteknik.com.tr</a></p>
